[P_01_Lighthouse_CnvMariaNarcissa]
POPUPMESSAGE_0017=Discover where the guerillas got their arms and equipment.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=THOMAS: Evening Star to Maria Narcissa, come in. Evening Star to Maria Narcissa, come in.
Speech_0002L=RADIO: Maria Narcissa here, go ahead Evening Star.
Speech_0003L=THOMAS: Cargo received Maria Narcissa, it all checks out.
Speech_0004L=THOMAS: Evening Star to Maria Narcissa, are you still there?
Speech_0005L=RADIO: Go ahead Evening Star. Are you in trouble?
Speech_0006L=THOMAS: No... everything seems to be fine... just some funny noises... we have your cargo. Everything is fine.
Speech_0007L=THOMAS: Evening Star to Maria Narcissa, come in.
Speech_0008L=RADIO: Go ahead Evening Star... we're hearing gunfire, is everything okay?
Speech_0009L=THOMAS: We had an enemy on sight, but we lost him.
Speech_0010L=RADIO: The army?
Speech_0011L=THOMAS: Not sure... some of the others are tracking him down... it's all under control now.
Speech_0012L=RADIO: You're sure?
Speech_0013L=THOMAS: Yes. And we have your cargo.  Everything is fine now.
Speech_0014L=RADIO: Roger that Evening Star, our crew is aboard, and we have cleared your beacon.
Speech_0015L=THOMAS: Affirmative Maria.
Speech_0016L=RADIO: Roger that. Maria Narcissa out.

[P_01_Lighthouse_CnvMorgenholt]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=EDUARDO: Don't you think he's had enough?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=HORACIO: He's had enough when he stops talking. 
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=EDUARDO: Talking? Madre de Dios... he's hasn't been able to speak for an hour.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=HORACIO: He could be faking it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=EDUARDO: Jesus....
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=SAUL: Si.  I bet he's faking it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0007L=EDUARDO: Faking it!? His tongue is a lump of coal... his brain is...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0008L=HORACIO: Enough!   Give me more juice Saul....
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0009L=SAUL: It's already at the maximum.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0010L=HORACIO: What?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=SAUL: Should I bring down another battery?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=HORACIO: Heh heh...  what do you say Amigo?  You want another battery?  Hunh?  Hunh?  Wait a minute... he's...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0013L=SAUL: His ears.... they're smoking....
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=EDUARDO: I think I'm going to be ill....
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0015L=SAUL: I think he's dead
Speech_-001L=(null)
Note_0022L=Morgenholt was tortured to death.
Speech_0016L=HORACIO: Hmph.  Only one way to be sure...
