Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=LEANDRO: Who would put a gate here anyway? It's stupid...pointless.
Speech_0005L=LEANDRO: Ay stupid gate!  Fix the gate.  Open the gate.  Close the gate.  Open the gate... well now the gate is broken.

[P_01_Lighthouse_Communications]
Note_0139L=Some guerillas may be using unusually modern guns.
Speech_0127L=LAMBERT - That didn't sound like AK gunfire Fisher, see if these guerillas have any unusual equipment and where it might have come from.
Speech_0007L=LAMBERT - I'm hearing gun fire down there Fisher....  is everything alright?
Speech_0008L=FISHER - It's coming from up ahead, but, Lambert... when I think 'guerilla', I think 'Kalashnikov'.
Speech_0011L=LAMBERT - What do you mean?
Speech_0012L=FISHER - I've had enough AK's fired at me in my time to tell you that that wasn't one.
Speech_0013L=LAMBERT - Alright. See if there is anything unusual going on with their equipment and keep us posted.
Speech_0102L=LAMBERT - That didn't sound like AK gunfire Fisher, see if these guerillas have any unusual equipment and where it might have come from.
Speech_0128L=LAMBERT - These guerillas have some high-tech gear Sam. See if you can scan the weapons crates with your EEV.
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - I think you're right about the equipment Sam.
Speech_0002L=FISHER - Yeah... they've got themselves a little stockpile of high tech kit here.
Speech_0003L=LAMBERT - Try and find out where they got it. See if those crates have SSCC barcodes on them and scan them with your EEV.
Speech_0103L=LAMBERT - These guerillas have some high-tech gear Sam. See if you can scan the weapons crates with your EEV.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=LAMBERT - The SSCC code is lot one of five.  See if you can find the other four.
Speech_0015L=FISHER - I'll do my best.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0016L=LAMBERT - That's four of the five crates Sam.  Keep your eyes peeled for the last one.
Speech_0129L=LAMBERT - That seemed to be the last of the crates Fisher. Good work.
Speech_0018L=LAMBERT - Good work Fisher. If we can analyze the intelligence you gathered from those crates, we can make a lot of people's jobs a whole lot safer.
Speech_0019L=FISHER - How come no one ever does things to make my job safer?
Speech_0020L=LAMBERT - If you want me to hire some more analysts to interpret information for you, I can do that...
Speech_0021L=FISHER - On second thought, the danger's not so bad.
Speech_0104L=LAMBERT - That seemed to be the last of the crates Fisher. Good work.
Speech_0130L=LAMBERT - Morgenholt's dead. There's nothing you could have done. Leave the body.
Speech_0022L=LAMBERT - It doesn't sound too good down there, Fisher.
Speech_0023L=FISHER - The sound isn't the problem... you should smell it...
Speech_0024L=LAMBERT - You're sure he's dead?
Speech_0025L=FISHER - Deader than Elvis.
Speech_0026L=LAMBERT - Alright, leave the body. We still need to recover any traces of the interrogation. Grim will call you back.
Speech_0105L=LAMBERT - Morgenholt's dead. There's nothing you could have done. Leave the body.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0027L=LAMBERT - Fisher... I said leave the body... we don't have the means to extract him...
Speech_0028L=FISHER - Just because he's dead doesn't mean I need to leave him hanging here like a piece of meat.
Speech_0029L=LAMBERT - Don't get too connected Fisher.  I need you to stay rational.
Speech_0030L=FISHER - You can spare thirty seconds for some simple dignity.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0031L=LAMBERT - Sam!  What are you doing?
Speech_0032L=FISHER - Making sure he's not suffering...
Speech_0033L=LAMBERT - Well leaving NATO rounds in his body is not going look good... leave the evidence alone and get moving.
Speech_0034L=FISHER - On my way.
Note_0121L=Lacerda has left the area on a boat.
Speech_0131L=LAMBERT - Sam, from everything we're seeing here it looks like Lacerda's already flown the coop. Scratch the objective. You don't need to worry about taking him out.
Speech_0035L=LAMBERT - I think that confirms it, Fisher.
Speech_0040L=FISHER - Yeah... seems like Lacerda's long gone.
Speech_0041L=LAMBERT - We'll see if we can track him through Echelon... don't worry about him for now. We'll keep you posted.
Note_0126L=Lacerda has left the area on a boat.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0106L=LAMBERT - Sam, from everything we're seeing here it looks like Lacerda's already flown the coop. Scratch the objective. You don't need to worry about taking him out.
Note_0140L=The guerillas have not set up an alarm system.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0042L=LAMBERT - From the looks of it, these guerilla's have a pretty temporary set-up. Seems unlikely they'll have any kind of alarm system on location. 
Speech_0107L=FISHER - Good.
Note_0141L=Extraction is at the top of the lighthouse with the light off.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0045L=LAMBERT - Fisher, your primary objectives are complete. We can extract you whenever you're ready. You'll need to signal for a helicopter pick up from the top of the lighthouse... but make sure the light is out first.
Speech_0108L=FISHER - Will do.
Note_0142L=The information taken from Morgenholt is stored on a server somewhere.
Speech_0132L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, we need to wipe any information that tech might have transferred to a server.
Speech_0046L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, it's Grim. We need to make sure that whatever Morgenholt might have told them about Masse's algorithms never leaves this site.
Speech_0047L=FISHER - Okay.
Speech_0048L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I detected a wireless link coming from the technician who left the room before you entered.
Speech_0049L=GRIMSDOTTIR:  The technician you just took out had a wireless connection running a few minutes ago.
Speech_0050L=FISHER:  So I'll need to recover any data he might have uploaded to their servers?
Speech_0051L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Exactly.
Speech_0109L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sam, we need to wipe any information that tech might have transferred to a server.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0052L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That computer is the one that the technician uploaded Morgenholt's information to.
Speech_0053L=FISHER - What should I do?
Speech_0054L=GRIMSDOTTIR - You'll have to access it and scrub the data.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0110L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That server is the one that the tech transferred the interrogation record to, you'll need to access it.
Speech_0133L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That takes care of any copies that the technician might have made of Morgenholt's data.
Speech_0063L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good work Sam. That'll contain whatever information Morgenholt might have given them.
Speech_0064L=FISHER - Won't they wonder what happened to it?
Speech_0065L=GRIMSDOTTIR - It was easy enough to make your little intrusion look like a memory allocation error... don't worry... we give you the best tools.
Speech_0111L=GRIMSDOTTIR - That takes care of any copies that the technician might have made of Morgenholt's data.
Speech_0134L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The guerillas appear to be in contact with a cargo ship called the Maria Narcissa. We're tracking her now...we might need to send you there.
Speech_0066L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Maria Narcissa...
Speech_0067L=FISHER - You're not trying to set me up on another blind date I hope...
Speech_0068L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The Maria Narcissa is a boat...
Speech_0069L=FISHER - So was the last girl you set me up with...
Speech_0070L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher!
Speech_0071L=FISHER - Sorry.
Speech_0072L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The Maria Narcissa is a cargo ship... owned and operated by... Celestinia Inc.... Portuguese shipping company... registered in the Philippines... cross Pacific freight contracts... lots of details missing...
Note_0124L=The arms were delivered from a cargo ship named the Maria Narcissa.
Speech_0073L=FISHER - Sounds suspicious...
Speech_0074L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Sounds like I'm setting you up for another date after all...
Speech_0075L=FISHER - Can't wait to meet her.
Speech_0112L=GRIMSDOTTIR - The guerillas appear to be in contact with a cargo ship called the Maria Narcissa. We're tracking her now...we might need to send you there.
Speech_0135L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher...you destroyed their comms, but we need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.
Speech_0076L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher... I think you just blasted their communications set-up.
Speech_0077L=FISHER - Good...  now they can't call for help.
Speech_0078L=GRIMSDOTTIR - True, but they also can't contact the smugglers who they've been dealing with. See if they keep a comm log on file somewhere.
Speech_0081L=FISHER - Okay.  I'll look around here.
Speech_0113L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher...you destroyed their comms, but we need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.
Speech_0136L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I think you just took out their radio operator. We need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.
Speech_0082L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Damn... you just took out their radio operator.
Speech_0083L=FISHER - He asked for it.
Speech_0084L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Well it's gonna be a lot harder to find out where they're smuggling their arms in from. You'd better check their radio logs. They probably keep a hardcopy archived on file somewhere.
Speech_0085L=FISHER - Okay. I'll look around here.
Speech_0114L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I think you just took out their radio operator. We need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.

Speech_0137L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good thinking Fisher. Without any communications gear they won't be able to tell their other cells that they've been hit.
Speech_0086L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good thinking Fisher. Without any communications gear they won't be able to tell their other cells that they've been hit.
Speech_0087L=FISHER - That's the idea.
Speech_0088L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Always one step ahead...
Speech_0089L=FISHER - The day I fall behind is the day I don't come home...
Speech_0115L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Good thinking Fisher. Without any communications gear they won't be able to tell their other cells that they've been hit.
Speech_0138L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Their radio and operator are down, but we need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.
Speech_0090L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Whoa... that was extreme...
Speech_0091L=FISHER - Radioman, and radio all at once...  I figured it was a good investment of resources...
Speech_0092L=GRIMSDOTTIR - I think he was radioing the smugglers who delivered the arms.
Speech_0093L=FISHER - Oh. Oops.
Speech_0094L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Well, check if they have a comm log on file somewhere.
Speech_0095L=FISHER - Okay. I'll look around here.
Speech_0096L=GRIMSDOTTIR - And take it easy Fisher... you were less messy when you were younger.
Speech_0097L=FISHER - The bad guys grew up... I had to adapt.
Speech_0116L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Their radio and operator are down, but we need to know who they've been communicating with. See if you can find their comm logs on file somewhere.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0098L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Whoa... that was extreme...
Speech_0099L=FISHER - Radioman, and radio all at once...  I figured it was a good investment of resources...
Speech_0100L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Maybe so... but it was still messy...
Speech_0101L=FISHER - The world's a messy place Grim.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0117L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Fisher, we don't have time to sort through files right now... see if you can find the info in a more practical form.

[P_01_Lighthouse_DeathControl]

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntCaptain]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER - Hi there, you look important.
Speech_0002L=SEGUNDO - I am loyal.  You will get no information from me.
Speech_0003L=FISHER - Really?  Hmmm...  it looks like you forgot to shave this morning.  Let me help you out a bit.
Speech_0004L=SEGUNDO - Ha!  You can't...   Hey!  ...  What are you doing???  Okay!  Okay...  What do you want to know?
Speech_0005L=FISHER - I'm looking for Lacerda.  He's been behaving very badly lately.
Speech_0006L=SEGUNDO - Well you're wasting your time, American.  He left on a boat an hour ago.  He could be anywhere by now.
Speech_0007L=FISHER - I guess I'll just have to follow him then.  Don't worry, he won't slip away.
Speech_0008L=SEGUNDO - Have a nice swim.
Speech_0009L=SEGUNDO - I hope the water is warm.
Speech_-001L=(null)
