[P_01_Lighthouse_IntCaveGuard]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: Didn't anyone ever tell you that spelunking is dangerous?
Speech_0002L=GUARD: Oh no...you're going to kill me aren't you?
Speech_0003L=FISHER: Only if you say the word 'monkey'.  Now tell me something I wanna know.
Speech_0006L=GUARD: Uh...if you need ammunition or medical supplies...check around inside the keep...they have tons of stuff in there.
Note_0015L=Medical supplies and ammunition are located in the keep.
Speech_0007L=FISHER: Some of you guys are real helpful...why do you have to work for the bad guys?
Speech_0008L=GUARD: You're the American oppressor...you're the bad guy...
Speech_0009L=FISHER: Are you gonna say 'monkey'?
Speech_0010L=GUARD: What? No....
Speech_0011L=FISHER: Then this conversation is over.
Speech_0012L=GUARD: Please don't kill me...please
Speech_0014L=GUARD: That's all I know...I swear

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntHighTechGun]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: Nice piece...where'd you get the gun?
Speech_0002L=FELIX:  Oh god...I don't know...I really don't know...
Speech_0003L=FISHER: That's bad news for you then...
Speech_0004L=FELIX:  Ah! I'd tell you if I knew...I swear...please don't kill me...
Speech_0005L=FISHER: Fine...if you don't know where the guns came from, then tell me something else that's useful...
Speech_0006L=FELIX:  Uh...uh...Morgenholt! Morgenholt...you must be here for him... he's in the room just ahead... I think they're torturing him.
Speech_0007L=FISHER: Torturing him, eh...thanks for the info.
Note_0014L=Morgenholt is being tortured.
Speech_0008L=FELIX:  N...n...no problem...
Speech_0009L=FISHER: I hate to tell you this...but your news comes a little too late...
Speech_0010L=FELIX:  Oh...oh...no...
Speech_0012L=FELIX:  I don't deserve to die...
Speech_0013L=FELIX:  I don't have any more information...I swear...

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntRadioRoom]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: Who were you talking to?
Speech_0002L=THOMAS:  What...who are you...
Speech_0003L=FISHER: I'm the guy who's going to break your knees if you don't tell me who you were talking to.
Speech_0004L=THOMAS:  Oh god...uh...it was Lacerda...Hugo Lacerda
Speech_0005L=FISHER: Where is he?
Speech_0006L=THOMAS:  He's aboard the ship...the Maria Narcissa...
Speech_0007L=FISHER: Why?
Speech_0008L=THOMAS:  Weapons...he is delivering the new weapons to the other cells....
Speech_0009L=FISHER: If I find out you're lying I will come back for you.
Speech_0010L=THOMAS:  Oh god...please....
Speech_0011L=THOMAS:  I swear, Lacerda isn't here
Speech_0012L=THOMAS:  I don't know anything else

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntThunder]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: Boo.
Speech_0002L=HECTOR: Ah...I knew you would come...
Speech_0003L=FISHER: What?
Speech_0004L=HECTOR: My whole life...my whole life I have been waiting for you to come in the thunder and the darkness and finish what you began...
Speech_0005L=FISHER: What are you talking about?
Speech_0006L=HECTOR: You are one of them...one of the Americans who killed my family...and now you've come back for me...
Speech_0007L=FISHER: Uh...I don't think so...
Speech_0008L=HECTOR: Do your worst...I have always known it would end this way...I am prepared to die...
Speech_0009L=FISHER: You're freaking me out...
Speech_0010L=HECTOR: Kill me...I long to see my family again...
Speech_0011L=HECTOR: I'm coming father...
Speech_0012L=HECTOR: I'm coming mother...

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntTorture]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0017L=FISHER: Why did you torture Morgenholt?
Speech_0018L=EDUARDO:  Ah! Uh... Lacerda... he wants algorithms...some kind of computer algorithm...
Note_0028L=Morgenholt was tortured to find out information about Masse Kernels.
Speech_0019L=FISHER: What does a second rate communist revolutionary want with a computer algorithm?
Speech_0020L=EDUARDO:  I don't know...I don't even think Lacerda knows...I think someone might have hired us.
Speech_0021L=FISHER: What makes you think that?
Speech_0022L=EDUARDO:  I don't know...Lacerda...he's been making lots of deals...something's going on...I don't know what...
Speech_0023L=FISHER: But you don't know who he's been talking to?
Speech_0024L=EDUARDO:  N...no...
Speech_0025L=FISHER: Then you're not much good to me anymore...
Speech_0026L=EDUARDO:  I told you everything...please don't kill me.
Speech_0027L=EDUARDO:  Have mercy...please...
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0029L=(null)
Speech_-001L=(null)
