[P_01_Lighthouse_IntTortureGuard]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: I already don't like you. Don't make it worse for yourself.
Speech_0002L=GUARD:  Who...who are you?
Speech_0003L=FISHER: Shut up. Why did you torture Morgenholt?
Speech_0004L=GUARD:  Lacerda told us to.
Speech_0005L=FISHER: Why? What does he want to know?
Speech_0006L=GUARD:  Math problems...programmer stuff...I don't get it.
Speech_0007L=FISHER: You're just the stupid one who likes to hurt people?
Speech_0008L=GUARD:  Ex...exactly.
Speech_0009L=FISHER: Can you think of a reason why the world wouldn't be a better place without you?
Speech_0010L=GUARD:  Uh....please...I...
Speech_0011L=FISHER: I didn't think so.
Speech_0016L=GUARD:  Please don't kill me...please
Speech_0017L=GUARD:  Lacerda made us...

[P_01_Lighthouse_IntWelderTech]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=FISHER: Whatcha workin' on?
Speech_0002L=LEANDRO: Ah! Oh god...who are you?
Speech_0003L=FISHER: I'm already tired of that question. Why don't you just answer mine?
Speech_0004L=LEANDRO: Uh...I'm...uh...trying to cut open this gate so I can get at the power cables inside...
Speech_0005L=LEANDRO: Uh...I'm...uh...trying to tap this power cable from the lighthouse...
Speech_0006L=LEANDRO: Uh...I'm...uh...going to head back to the server and check the power stability off the new line...
Speech_0007L=FISHER: Why?
Speech_0008L=LEANDRO: The power feeding the main server in the south west tower isn't stable... we need to protect the data.
Speech_0009L=FISHER: Hm...I've got some bad news for you then...because I already took care of the data on your server...
Speech_0010L=LEANDRO: Oh, no... Lacerda's going to kill me...
Speech_0011L=FISHER: I think you should be more worried about me than Lacerda...
Speech_0012L=FISHER: South west tower, hunh? Tell you what, I'll head back there and delete that data, and you won't have to worry about it...how's that sound?
Speech_0013L=LEANDRO: Do I have a choice?
Speech_0014L=FISHER: You could scream for help and force me to slit your throat...
Speech_0015L=LEANDRO: I'll pass...
Speech_0016L=LEANDRO: If you must... kill me quickly...
Speech_0017L=LEANDRO: Don't let me suffer...

[P_01_Lighthouse_KeepWaiting]

[P_01_Lighthouse_Master]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Fisher, an American engineer named Bruce Morgenholt has been kidnapped by a Peruvian separatist group called the People's Voice. Their suspected leader, Hugo Lacerda, is a hard-core revolutionary preaching information warfare as the only realistic means to achieve revolution in modern society. We need to you get in there and recover or destroy any information Morgenholt may have been forced to divulge, and, if possible, rescue him. As for Lacerda... he's just been bumped to onto our target of opportunity list, so if you have a shot, take it.
Speech_0002L=GRIMSDOTTIR - Hostage rescue isn't normally our bag, but Morgenholt was part of Project Watson, the UN Committee that studied Phillip Masse's handiwork after Georgia. Some people are worried that this kidnapping is just a cover-up and that Morgenholt is being interrogated for classified information about the Masse Kernels. Fact is that some of the tricks Masse came up with could be used to do a lot of damage. We need to contain that information at all costs.
Speech_0003L=REDDING - The target area is a lighthouse attached to an abandoned Spanish Colonial era fortification and some nearby structures. We don't have an exact location on Morgenholt, so you'll have to find him yourself. Insertion will be at night by zodiac onto the beach beneath the fort itself. Extraction will be back to the zodiac, or, in an emergency, via any available means. Thermal imaging shows that there are some old natural and semi-natural caves under the fort, so you may be able to use those for infiltration.
Speech_0004L=PARTRIDGE - Alright Fisher, the helicopter will drop you a few kilometers off shore in the Zodiac  you have one of my zodiacs and logistical support in and out of the target area. Extraction will be by helicopter from the top of the lighthouse
Speech_0005L=SHETLAND - Displace International holds the contract with Wright-Pritchard Technologies to protect their VIP's in potentially hostile situations. We did a thorough threat evaluation for their project in Peru and we accepted the VIP detail on Morgenholt. The guys who came after him knew what they were doing. This was not a tourist grab. I lost three good men in the snatch, and I'm currently preparing a rescue plan for approval from Morgenholt's family and Wright-Pritchard. This is gonna cost Displace a lot of money.
Speech_0006L=O'DELL - ...in other news...international rescue workers responding to Thursday's earthquake in northern Iran were fired upon following rumors that European agents were posing as aid workers in order to search the ruins of local government buildings destroyed in the quake ...
Speech_0007L=O'DELL - ...contact was lost hours ago with the ISS following what is now being reported as a possible strike by a micrometeor. NASA officials are currently verifying that orbital debris from previous space missions was not responsible for the accident. No contact has yet been made with either the astronauts aboard the ISS or with the shuttle which is docked to the station...

[P_01_Lighthouse_NPCControl]

[P_01_Lighthouse_NPCControl2]

[P_01_Lighthouse_Objectives]
Objective_0024=Rescue Morgenholt
Objective_0025=If possible, rescue Bruce Morgenholt from the guerillas. Do not compromise the mission for the rescue.
Objective_0001=Recover or destroy information about the Masse Kernels
Objective_0016=Any information the guerillas may have gotten from Morgenholt must be recovered or destroyed, and any copies of it must be erased from computers or servers.
Objective_0005=Eliminate Hugo Lacerda
Objective_0018=Hugo Lacerda has been elevated to Third Echelon's Target of Opportunity list. Take advantage of any possible opportunity to remove him from the list.
POPUPMESSAGE_0026=Rescue Morgenholt
Objective_0011=Discover where the guerillas got their arms and equipment.
Objective_0019=The guerillas have seemingly received weapons from an unknown party, possibly as payment for the kidnapping of Morgenholt. Discover where the weapons came from.
POPUPMESSAGE_0027=Discover where the guerillas got their arms and equipment.
Objective_0008=Scan the SSCC Bar Code of the delivered crates.
Objective_0020=Scan the weapons crates containing weapons delivered to Lacerda by checking them manually or by using your EEV.
Objective_0010=Recover or destroy information about the Mass Kernels
Objective_0013=Disable the guerilla's communications equipment.
