Objective_0014=Disable the guerilla's communications equipment.
Objective_0022=(null)
Objective_0033=Exfiltrate to the primary extraction point
Objective_0034=Exfiltrate from the top of the lighthouse by clearing the upper platform and disabling the lighthouse light.
