[P_01_Lighthouse_SRCAboutGirl]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=So...uh...you 'member that little chiquita from the bar last Friday?
Speech_0002L=The one with the tight t-shirt...how could I forget?
Speech_0003L=She called me man! We gonna go have dinner. Gonna take her to Rick's man.
Speech_0006L=Rick's? That place is expensive.
Speech_0007L=Heh heh...nothin' too good for my baby...but uhhh...
Speech_0008L=But what?
Speech_0009L=You..uh...you think I can borrow some money 'til we get paid?

[P_01_Lighthouse_SRCAstronauts]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Too bad it's overcast...
Speech_0002L=Why?
Speech_0003L=They say that we're at the right latitude to see the debris re-entering the atmosphere...
Speech_0004L=Debris? What debris? What are you talking about?
Speech_0005L=Madre de Dios, you didn't hear? The International Space Station...there's been an accident. They've lost radio contact, and they've confirmed that there's major damage. They expect a debris shower sometime this evening.
Speech_0006L=Hmm...In pride...in reasoning pride our error lies...all quit their sphere and rush into the skies...
Speech_0007L=Him, the Almighty power hurled headlong and flaming from the ethereal sky, who durst defy the omnipotent to arms...
Speech_0008L=Ay...and I thought I was a dilettante...
Speech_0009L=Education is the difference between a revolutionary and a terrorist....

[P_01_Lighthouse_SRCSoccerPlayer]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Have you seen the newspapers?
Speech_0002L=No? What is it?
Speech_0003L=It's...it's...it's Hernandez.
Speech_0004L=Hernandez?! No! He's injured?
Speech_0005L=Worse...
Speech_0006L=No!  Dead?!
Speech_0007L=...worse...he's been traded to Melgar Football Club.
Speech_0008L=Traded?! Never!! Impossible! I will not hear this!
Speech_0009L=I swear it is the truth...
Speech_0010L=If you are mistaken...I swear on the honor of my sister that I will cut off your head and use it as a bowling ball...
Speech_0011L=It is true...check the papers...
Speech_0012L=I'm going to kill myself.

